  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Protection Workshop for CAFOD Colombian Partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD has recently started working with a number of Colombian partners on child protection, to support the development and implementation of child protection policies at the institutional level and this project seeks to bring those partners together to share experiences and develop a sound understanding of child protection policies and their importance for their work and projects. A two day workshop will be held in Bogota in late October/early November with 3 key staff members participating from each partner, with certain sessions facilitated by an external consultant. Support will be provided by CAFOD particularly in the design of the workshop, the materials to be produced and the contracting of an external consultant to advise on child protection policy design.</narrative>
  </description>
